WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.900
Here's how Nexus Prepare takes a purchase
invoice from the inbox to review.

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:12.380
A sample invoice image arrives
through the mobile intake service.

00:00:12.485 --> 00:00:15.650
It appears in the Costs inbox
as a purchase invoice.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:24.130
Open the invoice record
to see the original attachment.

00:00:24.241 --> 00:00:27.200
Select Process to send the document
for review.

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:36.060
In this demo, the reviewer enters
the details manually.

00:00:36.171 --> 00:00:42.100
They check the supplier, invoice number
and total of £2,220 against the original.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.920
Once the details match,
approve the record.

00:00:52.043 --> 00:00:56.300
The original invoice remains attached,
so you can refer back to it later.
